{"availability":"available","full":"s-shemmee/Weather-App","name":"Weather-App","description":"This is a weather app created with HTML, CSS, and vanilla JavaScript. Users can search for weather conditions of any city using SheCodes Weather API and OpenWeatherMap API, view current weather and 5-day forecast, hourly forecasts, and detect their current position.","category":"Design","language":"JavaScript","stars":19,"forks":5,"created":"2023-03-10T23:30:11Z","updated":"2024-04-08T23:08:24Z","license":"GPL-3.0","branch":"main","homepage":"https://weather-app-shemmee.netlify.app","topics":["html","html-css-javascript","javascript","netlify","shecodes","vanilla-javascript","weather","weather-api","weather-app","weather-forecast"],"demo":"https://weather-app-shemmee.netlify.app/","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-06T09:12:02.446Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-06T09:12:02.446Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-06T09:12:02.446Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-06T09:12:02.446Z","stars":19,"forks":5}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["This is a web app developed as a final project for SheCodes Plus using HTML, CSS, and Vanilla JavaScript. It is hosted on Netlify and utilizes both SheCodes Weather API and OpenWeatherMap API to fetch weather data. The app allows users to search for the weather conditions of any city in the world and provides current weather conditions, a 5-day forecast, and hourly forecasts. Additionally, the app can detect the user's current position if they allow it."],"features":["Users can search for weather conditions of any city in the world.","The app displays the current weather conditions, including temperature and weather description.","The app provides a 5-day forecast for the searched city, including hourly forecasts.","The app can detect the user's current position if they allow it.","The app fetches weather data using both SheCodes Weather API and OpenWeatherMap API."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.co